{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14108072","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108072","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410807101:":{"text":"这边！","source_cn":"这边！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E17425FF421273","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"这边！","female":"这边！","variant_male_record_index":"160212","variant_female_record_index":"160213","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410807102:":{"text":"两位，出来吧","source_cn":"两位，出来吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0FE1698D4B330855","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"两位，出来吧","female":"两位，出来吧","variant_male_record_index":"160214","variant_female_record_index":"160215","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410807201:1":{"text":"沙利叶，现在卫队一团乱，你能不能好好约束自己的队伍！","source_cn":"沙利叶，现在卫队一团乱，你能不能好好约束自己的队伍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADCE691B5E4B53BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410807202:1":{"text":"哦，那又如何？说来也都是你们的错……","source_cn":"哦，那又如何？说来也都是你们的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC5BD77677A9F841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410807203:1":{"text":"我们的错？","source_cn":"我们的错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27E73361593E432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410807204:1":{"text":"谁让你们把因度厄关了起来，他不管，卫队可不就瘫痪了。","source_cn":"谁让你们把因度厄关了起来，他不管，卫队可不就瘫痪了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D2F0E0ABA802CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410807205:1":{"text":"你才是卫队的统领！","source_cn":"你才是卫队的统领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802BB5307F8F6161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410807206:1":{"text":"管理者不需要自己过问，手下才是真正干活的人。你既然知道每个人的职责，就少管卫队的事。","source_cn":"管理者不需要自己过问，手下才是真正干活的人。你既然知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F3C51072F09C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410807207:1":{"text":"我可不知道一旦缺乏管教，那些易怒的平民又会做出什么事来。为了不让秩序失守，你们最好把因度厄早点放出来。","source_cn":"我可不知道一旦缺乏管教，那些易怒的平民又会做出什么事来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81EE6B83A43CC3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410807208:1":{"text":"不可能，他已经知道了太多，又违逆了女王陛下。","source_cn":"不可能，他已经知道了太多，又违逆了女王陛下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C350167DBFF92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:14